uencing high-impact domains and driving global knowledge society worldwide. Join our community and help shape the future with more than 10,000 colleagues. Discover our beautiful hometown Ghent Ghent is a divers, vibrant and opportunity-rich city, connecting expats from all over the globe. Join our community and expand your international network. Go to slide 1 Go to slide 2 Discover our job offers Professorial staff Assistant academic staff Researchers Fellowships Administration, ICT, management, technology and logistics Innovation and valorisation Search by Keyword Show More Options Loading... Staff category All Faculty / University service All Occupancy rate All Location All Clear Here you can find our job opportunities for PhD students and (post)doctoral fellows. Are you looking for a student job or do you want to contribute to Ghent University as a volunteer? Here you can find more information (in Dutch). Ghent University yesterday, today and tomorrow * If you cannot see the video, please accept the functional cookies for Youtube in the Cookie Consent Manager. selecties@ugent.be FAQ Privacy policy Cookie Consent Manager Cookie declaration Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. © UGent | Sint-Pietersnieuwstraat 25 | 9000 Ghent | Belgium × Cookie Consent Manager When you visit any website, it may store or retrieve information on your browser, mostly in the form of cookies. Because we respect your right to privacy, you can choose not to allow some types of cookies. However, blocking some types of cookies may impact your experience of the site and the services we are able to offer. Required Cookies These cookies are required to use this website and can't be turned off. Required Cookies Show More Details Required Cookies Provider Description Enabled SAP as service provider We use the following session cookies, which are all required to enable the website to function: \"route\" is used for session stickiness 